      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What is MUTO?",
            "a": "<p>A daily cellular protocol for people who still train and aren’t done yet. Two capsules with breakfast, 19 ingredients, every dose on the label. MUTO supports the 30 trillion cells in your body through NAD+ and other nutrients.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Which ingredients are in MUTO?",
            "a": "<p>300mg NR (the most allowed in Great Britain), 450mg TMG, 150mg CoQ10, a methylated B complex, vitamin D3 and K2, zinc, copper, PQQ, grapeseed, trans-resveratrol and BioPerine®. Every dose is on the label. Ask your AI, your GP or Richie, who answers formula questions himself.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How do I know if MUTO is right for me?",
            "a": "<p>Try it. Note how you feel before you start, or take a 7-day average if you wear a watch. Give it 90 days, then compare. If you don’t see a difference, you’re covered.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What does MUTO replace?",
            "a": "<p>For many customers, several separate pots: B vitamins, vitamin D, K2, zinc and CoQ10 are all in here, at the doses shown. Don’t stop anything you take for a medical reason, and check with your GP if you take medicine.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How do I take it?",
            "a": "<p>Two capsules with breakfast, every day. No caffeine and no stimulants, so there’s nothing to time around training.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q6": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Can I cancel?",
            "a": "<p>Yes. Skip, pause or cancel online, any time. We remind you 5 days before every payment.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
